Some change between 2.6.16 and 2.6.17 causes one of my
systems to wait for 2 minutes during the boot process.
It appears to be SATA because that is the next message
after the timeout during the boot cycle.

I am still bisecting down to find the exact culprit.

This is an i386 based system with nForce 4 chipset.
There is one drive on SATA and one DVD burner on IDE1.


